THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

The terms above cover only the source code written for MediaTANK. They do not
and cannot apply to the third-party libraries this application links against;
those keep their own licences, some of which are copyleft. See
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

Two of them matter in particular. libVLC and jcifs-ng are distributed under the
LGPL. As long as this application is only built and installed on the author's
own devices, the LGPL imposes no obligations, because those obligations attach
to distribution. They would apply the moment the application — or an APK built
from it — is handed to anyone else.

